{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45062","headline":"同颜使君真卿李侍御萼游法华寺登凤翅山望太湖 · 皎然","name":"同颜使君真卿李侍御萼游法华寺登凤翅山望太湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双峰开凤翅，秀出南湖州。\n地势抱郊树，山威增郡楼。\n正逢周柱史，来会鲁诸侯。\n缓步凌彩蒨，清铙发飕飀。\n披云得灵境，拂石临芳洲。\n积翠遥空碧，含风广泽秋。\n萧辰资丽思，高论惊精修。\n何似锺山集，[徵]文及惠休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}